<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $100 mln in May 21 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $100 mln in May 21 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $100 million to $814.5 billion in the week ended May 21, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
